Bind Npc 31564 Zone 11 for karus
Bind Npc 31563 Zone 12 for elmorad
Quest 652 "New Specialty Goods"
    Journal for karus "You must accept the request of [Trader] Drill."
    Journal for elmorad "You must accept the request of [Trader] Ellon. "

Requires player level >= 65 and quest 651 is completed

Rewards none

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "I think [Merchant] Drill has something to say to you. Go talk to him."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "I think [Trader] Ellen has something to say to you. Go talk to him."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "We broke up with other party at the Port Pugative and came striaght here first to Islant."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Our mission is to collect articles that are rare and precious to Islant area.\n\nBut with the failure to employ combat troops, we are just sitting here stand-by. But now that the captain sent us you, would you please help us?\n\nThe Eslant updated traders will need to drill and conversation."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "We broke up with other party at the Port Hashak and came striaght here first to Islant."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Our mission is to collect articles that are rare and precious to Islant area.\n\nBut with the failure to employ combat troops, we are just sitting here stand-by. But now that the captain sent us you, would you please help us?\n\nEslant updated traders should be a conversation with Ellen."

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "You're going to help us, aren't you? Good. Then, let's collect the items that we decided to collect, one by one. First, collect the [Blood of Berserker] from [Half Troll Berserker] and then deliver it to [Appraiser] Rockus. It's very popular because it hugely increases the body's adrenaline."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "You're going to help us, aren't you? Good. Then, let's collect the items that we decided to collect, one by one. First, collect the [Blood of Berserker] from [Half Troll Berserker] and then deliver it to [Appraiser] Diz. It's very popular because it hugely increases the body's adrenaline."
